%% A sequence diagram: signing in.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant App as Web app
    participant Auth
    title: Signing in
    User->>App: Open the page
    App->>+Auth: Request a session
    Auth-->>-App: Session token
    Note right of Auth: Tokens expire hourly
    Note over User,App: The page is ready
    activate App
    loop Every minute
        App->Auth: Ping
        Auth-->App: Pong
    end
    alt token valid
        App-)User: Show the dashboard
    else
        App--)User: Ask again
    end
    opt remember me
        App-xAuth: Store a refresh token
    end
    par notify
        App--xUser: Email sent
    and audit
        App->>Auth: Log the sign in
    end
    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
        User->>App: Sign out
    end
    deactivate App
    link Auth: Dashboard @ https://auth.example.com
